  (2, 139, $d$This glorious staff, fashioned from a length of yew nearly the size of an adult
human, represents pinnacle mastery over the very essence of elemental earth
itself.  It is capable of using the forces of the earth to pull apart and
disintegrate any object or creature it encounters.  Decorated heavily with
runes and sigils of earth and death and topped with a large pure emerald, the
staff is an exquisite masterwork of elemental craftsmanship - the perfect
synthesis of art and magic.$d$, $d$This glorious staff, fashioned from a length of yew nearly the size of an adult
