  (2, 144, $d$As you try to fix your eyes on whatever this weapon is, it seems to shift and
drift about, almost like it is actively evading discernment.  From what you can
make of its ghostly form, it appears to be a mace or hammer of some variety.
The material it's assembled from is obviously magical, as it's both
semi-translucent and only semi-solid.$d$, $d$As you try to fix your eyes on whatever this weapon is, it seems to shift and
