What better way to destroy darkness than with darkness itself?$d$),
  (2, 146, $d$Made from the finest gold and the impossibly rare mystic metal mythril, this
incredible piece of craftsmanship is a true marvel to behold.  It harnesses the
power of heavenly celestials, those most ardent enemies of darkness, to
vanquish the undead.  Only those most dedicated to righteousness ever receive
such a gift.$d$, $d$Made from the finest gold and the impossibly rare mystic metal mythril, this
