  (2, 171, $d$This small pair of yellow orbs are actually a set of tiny snake eyes, carefully
preserved in some kind of resin.  They are a brilliant yellow with a vertically
elliptical pupil in the middle.  This thin tattoo lays right on one eyebrow,
curving over the ridge like the natural curve of a snake's fang.  The fang is
