the feathers.  The use of shading and highlights creates a sense of depth and
movement in the feathers.  It incorporates intricate swirls in the details of
the feathers, evoking the image of the moving air.$d$, $d$This small pair of yellow orbs are actually a set of tiny snake eyes, carefully
