hidden depth.  The scale does not quite burn, but does impart a sense of a
curious combination of heat, strength, knowledge, and power.$d$),
  (4, 13, $d$There is an eerie sort of quality to these gloves.  They are a cloudy grey
color which traps the light shone upon them.  The fingers are long and the
gloves appear to have been bent permanently, being most comfortable in the
shape of a solid, firm fist.  The materials from which they were created seems
rather unusual and could well be supernatural judging by the look of them.$d$, $d$There is an eerie sort of quality to these gloves.  They are a cloudy grey
