  (4, 14, $d$These boots are made of some sort of oddly shiny material.  There are cut-laces
up the sides, wrapping around the ankle.  The laces do not appear to end, and
there is no visible knot in them.  The boots seem to float just a touch,
hovering with a small amount of air between them and the ground on which they
rest.  The green-blue coloration seems to melt into any grass or earth they
come into contact with.$d$, $d$These boots are made of some sort of oddly shiny material.  There are cut-laces
