  (4, 15, $d$This lightweight hide is said to have been worn by the fabled explorer,
Aslyfaer during his many expeditions across Caelia.  Crafted from the hides of
ravenous blue fog mist beasts and lined with a mythril chain padding, this
midnight blue armor gives its wearer an added layer of protection without the
cumbersome weight of scale armors.$d$, $d$This lightweight hide is said to have been worn by the fabled explorer,
