polished, giving it a beautiful brushed sheen.  The shard feels heavy, as
though it was cast from solid gold.  On the back of the scale, a tiny pin makes
it easy to clip onto a cloak or tunic.  A small dragon claw is etched into the
clip.$d$, $d$Not much more than a sliver from a much larger dragonscale, the surface of this
shard still has the golden glow of its original beast.  The shard is heavily
polished, giving it a beautiful brushed sheen.  The shard feels heavy, as
though it was cast from solid gold.  On the back of the scale, a tiny pin makes
it easy to clip onto a cloak or tunic.  A small dragon claw is etched into the
clip.$d$),
  (4, 187, $d$Sewn from the finest off-white cotton threads, this well-worn pair of
previously owned stockings promise its wearer warmth and comfort no
matter the environment.  Some slight stains mar the stretchy fabric,
but they are undoubtedly just an artifact of the production process.$d$, $d$Sewn from the finest off-white cotton threads, this well-worn pair of
previously owned stockings promise its wearer warmth and comfort no
matter the environment.  Some slight stains mar the stretchy fabric,
but they are undoubtedly just an artifact of the production process.$d$),
  (4, 188, $d$The armband is made from heavy canvas, with several large pockets around
its circumference.  Several clasps allow the armband to be affixed on
an arm, beneath one's heavier armor.$d$, $d$The armband is made from heavy canvas, with several large pockets around
its circumference.  Several clasps allow the armband to be affixed on
an arm, beneath one's heavier armor.$d$),
  (4, 189, $d$Constructed from a large bough of an evergreen tree, twisted back upon itself
into a large circle, this wreath smells with the wondrous winter scent of
Christmas.  Various pine cones and berries are tied into the wreath, and a
large red bow on one side adds a vibrant splash of color to the decoration.
The hole in the center is fairly wide, probably large enough to fit over your
head...$d$, $d$Constructed from a large bough of an evergreen tree, twisted back upon itself
into a large circle, this wreath smells with the wondrous winter scent of
Christmas.  Various pine cones and berries are tied into the wreath, and a
large red bow on one side adds a vibrant splash of color to the decoration.
The hole in the center is fairly wide, probably large enough to fit over your
head...$d$),
  (4, 190, $d$The mask is a stark white, depicting a man with strong features and a
jovial grin.  The lips and cheeks are dusted pink, and the mustache and
eyebrows are painted black.  The edges of the mouth are slightly upturned
in a knowing smile.  Something appears to be written on the inside.$d$, $d$The mask is a stark white, depicting a man with strong features and a
jovial grin.  The lips and cheeks are dusted pink, and the mustache and
eyebrows are painted black.  The edges of the mouth are slightly upturned
in a knowing smile.  Something appears to be written on the inside.$d$),
  (4, 191, $d$The gauntlets are crafted from finely treated alligator skin, its
leathery surface offering a balance of durability and flexibility.
The insides of the gauntlets are padded with softer cloth.$d$, $d$The gauntlets are crafted from finely treated alligator skin, its
leathery surface offering a balance of durability and flexibility.
The insides of the gauntlets are padded with softer cloth.$d$),
  (4, 192, $d$This ketoh is a unique white leather bracer, carefully bound by beautiful brown
leather straps.  It is long enough to cover from the wrist to midway up the
forearm, featuring a center motif which depicts a flying white griffin.  A line
of rich turquoise gems line the edges of the ketoh.  The inside is comfortably
padded with cotton and linen.$d$, $d$This ketoh is a unique white leather bracer, carefully bound by beautiful brown
leather straps.  It is long enough to cover from the wrist to midway up the
forearm, featuring a center motif which depicts a flying white griffin.  A line
of rich turquoise gems line the edges of the ketoh.  The inside is comfortably
padded with cotton and linen.$d$),
  (4, 193, $d$The spectacles are sleek and stylish with a wiry silver frame and soft,
blue-tinted lenses.  Looking through the glasses seems to make the whole world
look cooler, but everything seems to move just a little slower...$d$, $d$The spectacles are sleek and stylish with a wiry silver frame and soft,
blue-tinted lenses.  Looking through the glasses seems to make the whole world
look cooler, but everything seems to move just a little slower...$d$),
  (4, 194, $d$Humming with magical power it resonates on a primal level.  This skull must
have belonged to a baby dragon or have been shrunken by some great magic maybe
both?  Its neutral power appears to trail out looking for some other power to
mingle and mix with.$d$, $d$Humming with magical power it resonates on a primal level.  This skull must
have belonged to a baby dragon or have been shrunken by some great magic maybe
both?  Its neutral power appears to trail out looking for some other power to
mingle and mix with.$d$),
  (4, 195, $d$A bright red christmas stocking, it looks comfortable and
warm, fitting snuggly on just about any head.  It has a large,
white puffy ball that hangs from the end of the stocking and
glittering letters that read : Jolly Fat Bastard.$d$, $d$A bright red christmas stocking, it looks comfortable and
warm, fitting snuggly on just about any head.  It has a large,
white puffy ball that hangs from the end of the stocking and
glittering letters that read : Jolly Fat Bastard.$d$),
  (4, 197, $d$A pair of demonic-looking eyes, dark-rimmed and loathsome, burn here with a
flame that is not borne of wood.  No heat rises from the fire that engulfs the
orbs, and they are not held onto the face by any kind of strings or supports,
instead hovering before the eyes and infecting all the wearer sees with a
flaming malevolence.$d$, $d$A pair of demonic-looking eyes, dark-rimmed and loathsome, burn here with a
flame that is not borne of wood.  No heat rises from the fire that engulfs the
orbs, and they are not held onto the face by any kind of strings or supports,
instead hovering before the eyes and infecting all the wearer sees with a
flaming malevolence.$d$),
  (4, 198, $d$This ring has a slight glow.  The flower which is magically attached to the
band is made of crystal.  The band itself is a pale jade, carved perfectly to
fit a slender finger.  There is a magical power about it would cause the ring
to react badly to the wrong kinds of people.  It has a beautiful quality and
glow about it, which no doubt helps the person wearing the ring to be stronger
and gives them a special, friendly quality.$d$, $d$This ring has a slight glow.  The flower which is magically attached to the
