  (23, 23, $d$This ancient stone monolith appears to have stood here for centuries,
withstanding the years of weathering and other adverse conditions. A
blanket of bright green vines wind their way up its length, prospering
from the nearby druidic magic. Several passages are visible on the
monolith:


The ancient monoliths of the east were built south of a great, icy lake.
Father Ghelin and Me'neil were proud of these standing stones, erected
with as much care as the previous four. Guarding the strange energies there,
they are watched always by an member of the order, and provide the earth
mother's children with a means of communication.$d$, $d$This ancient stone monolith appears to have stood here for centuries,
withstanding the years of weathering and other adverse conditions. A
blanket of bright green vines wind their way up its length, prospering
from the nearby druidic magic. Several passages are visible on the
