  (30, 121, $d$Reminiscent of a miniature halfling, this soft felt puppet fits snugly over one
hand, and is created from soft multicolored felt.  It has a mischievous grin
stitched on its face, with black glass eyes peering out from a black cloth
helm.  Oddly, the halfling has two little spiky canines protruding from its
mouth.  Perhaps the puppet was meant to scare little children?$d$, $d$Reminiscent of a miniature halfling, this soft felt puppet fits snugly over one
