  (30, 122, $d$The little doll is sewn together from scraps of cloth.  Facial features are
stitched carefully on the head, depicting a mischievous smile.  Something about
the doll just makes you want to pat it on the head!  A hooded cloak made of
brown felt fits the doll nicely, covering the seams where the arms are
attached.  Each arm has an odd little sword sewn on--the hilts are metallic,
but the blades are a strange glowing material.  The swords' glow slowly
alternates between subtle brightening and dimming, casting varying shadows on
the doll's face which seem to make its eyes come alive.$d$, $d$The little doll is sewn together from scraps of cloth.  Facial features are
