  (30, 303, $d$
Welcome to Fiery Mud!

Here you will learn powerful new spells and skills that will enable you
to venture ever further into this strange new world...
Power and riches beyond your wildest dreams could become yours -
if you have what it takes!

This pamphlet will guide you along your first steps on Fiery.
It is meant to keep you from making the same mistakes newbies have been
making time after time. Some of this might not be new to you, other
things are specific to Fiery.

Here are some helpful tips to get you going, type "look <tip>":
        COMMANDS -> A list of helpful commands.
        FIGHTS   -> A brief summary over fighting.
        LEVELING -> A brief summary about advancing and guilds.
        RENTING  -> A brief summary about leaving Fiery, and misc things.
        RULES    -> A quick list of Fiery rules.
        MAP      -> A map of Mielikki.
        CLOSING  -> Final advice and if you have questions.
NOTE: All bold words within these 5 subtopics are commands that can be typed.$d$, $d$
