  (103, 0, $d$It shimmers of its own light, constantly reflecting the emotional state of its
owner.  The setting is a delicate filgiree net that encases the crystal and
keeps it safe while still allowing it to be visible.  A strange energy shocks
anyone who tries to touch it directly unless the crystal is their own.$d$, $d$It shimmers of its own light, constantly reflecting the emotional state of its
owner.  The setting is a delicate filgiree net that encases the crystal and
keeps it safe while still allowing it to be visible.  A strange energy shocks
anyone who tries to touch it directly unless the crystal is their own.$d$),
  (103, 1, $d$This is a simple, fuzzy white towel.  It looks quite water-absorbant and is the
kind of thing you'd want to wear around your head to keep your hair from
getting soaked, or to dry off your hair in case it's already wet.  There's a
small tag on one end that reads, "Property of Phoenix Feather Hot Springs".$d$, $d$This is a simple, fuzzy white towel.  It looks quite water-absorbant and is the
kind of thing you'd want to wear around your head to keep your hair from
getting soaked, or to dry off your hair in case it's already wet.  There's a
small tag on one end that reads, "Property of Phoenix Feather Hot Springs".$d$),
  (103, 2, $d$This is a large, fluffy towel dyed dark green.  Though it is well-made, it
looks like it's seen plenty of use and has a slight sulfur smell from the
mineral water.  Still, it would be good either to dry oneself off or to wear
around the waist to preserve decency while bathing.  A small tag on one of the
hems says "Phoenix Feather Hot Springs".$d$, $d$This is a large, fluffy towel dyed dark green.  Though it is well-made, it
looks like it's seen plenty of use and has a slight sulfur smell from the
mineral water.  Still, it would be good either to dry oneself off or to wear
around the waist to preserve decency while bathing.  A small tag on one of the
hems says "Phoenix Feather Hot Springs".$d$),
  (103, 3, $d$This cute towel is the pure blue of a winter sky.  Made of fine cotton, it
would be ideal for covering oneself in the hot springs or for drying off
afterwards.  Though well-used, it seems to be in good condition.  A white tag
on the hem says, "Property of Phoenix Feather Hot Springs".$d$, $d$This cute towel is the pure blue of a winter sky.  Made of fine cotton, it
would be ideal for covering oneself in the hot springs or for drying off
afterwards.  Though well-used, it seems to be in good condition.  A white tag
on the hem says, "Property of Phoenix Feather Hot Springs".$d$),
  (103, 4, $d$Made of beaten gold and shaped into the fearsome visage of a scowling demon,
this mask is complete with curling white horns.  Sure to frighten anyone gazing
upon it, the demon's face is both ugly and true to form.  Perhaps it was
modeled after a real demon.$d$, $d$Made of beaten gold and shaped into the fearsome visage of a scowling demon,
this mask is complete with curling white horns.  Sure to frighten anyone gazing
upon it, the demon's face is both ugly and true to form.  Perhaps it was
modeled after a real demon.$d$),
  (103, 5, $d$This lanters glows with a strange, almost dark light.  A brass shielding lets
the user focus the light on one side or, by lowering it, allows the light to
spread around and illuminate everything.  Though ancient, the goldwork is plain
and the only decoration is a dragon etched on the handle.$d$, $d$This lanters glows with a strange, almost dark light.  A brass shielding lets
the user focus the light on one side or, by lowering it, allows the light to
spread around and illuminate everything.  Though ancient, the goldwork is plain
and the only decoration is a dragon etched on the handle.$d$),
  (103, 6, $d$It's a scrumptious-looking apple, dripping with yummy apple juice and crunching
noisily when bitten into.  It looks quite fresh, and would surely taste
excellent.  It's nice and round and has nary a wormhole, so what are you
waiting for??  Eat it!$d$, $d$It's a scrumptious-looking apple, dripping with yummy apple juice and crunching
noisily when bitten into.  It looks quite fresh, and would surely taste
excellent.  It's nice and round and has nary a wormhole, so what are you
waiting for??  Eat it!$d$),
  (103, 7, $d$These finely ground lenses must be gnomish work, for they seem to be flawless.
The rims are a thin silver and the nosepiece seems quite comfortable.  They
would surely be a great help to someone who has no near-vision that wants to
read a book or crochet or do anything else that requires them to see things
close up.$d$, $d$These finely ground lenses must be gnomish work, for they seem to be flawless.
The rims are a thin silver and the nosepiece seems quite comfortable.  They
would surely be a great help to someone who has no near-vision that wants to
read a book or crochet or do anything else that requires them to see things
close up.$d$),
  (103, 8, $d$This finely woven cloak is made of pure white satin with cotton embroidery
marking out an abstract bird symbol on the back which, though it is also in
white, shows up in string light due to the difference in luster between the two
fabrics.  Long ties at the neck can be used to fasten the cloak against the
chill winds of the north.  It looks like it would also make great camoflauge in
the snow.$d$, $d$This finely woven cloak is made of pure white satin with cotton embroidery
marking out an abstract bird symbol on the back which, though it is also in
white, shows up in string light due to the difference in luster between the two
fabrics.  Long ties at the neck can be used to fasten the cloak against the
chill winds of the north.  It looks like it would also make great camoflauge in
the snow.$d$),
  (103, 9, $d$A sizeable pitcher made of some dwarven alloy that won't rust or tarnish even
in the steam from the hot springs sits on a stone shelf.  Condensation has
formed on the outside of the pitcher, and it has a little cap to prevent the
water inside from evaporating.  It must be magically cooled as well, but then,
the resort IS owned and managed by a cryomancer.$d$, $d$A sizeable pitcher made of some dwarven alloy that won't rust or tarnish even
