   Be very wary wayward traveler.  From this point on the mi
   and the creatures more fierce than those previously encoun
   trail.  Be especially weary of the most sinister of them, called a
   by we unfortunate souls.  I was the first and last to escape the danger,
   and took it upon myself to return and place this warning.

There is nothing further on the sign or post other than a thick damp caused
no doubt by the fog surrounding everything here.$d$, $d$The sign is scratched as if an animal frequently sharpens its claws upon it.
