  (123, 98, $d$This belt appears to be made of small silver discs set with dark blue starstone
hemispheres.  However, upon closer inspection, you realize the glittering dots
within the hemispheres are not merely reflecting light - they are diminutive
pinpoints of luminescence contained in some kind of crystalline matrix.  They
swirl and float, giving a cosmic life to each disc.  Surely a treasure like
this must be a gift from the Gods!$d$, $d$This belt appears to be made of small silver discs set with dark blue starstone
