  (123, 99, $d$Examining this tiny light more closely, it becomes obvious this is no meager
glass or crystal.  It is the heart of a newborn star, breathed into creation
through divine providence.  Within it lay all the hopes and dreams of creation,
which perhaps could become another legendary soul, or a cosmic array of life
and potential.$d$, $d$Examining this tiny light more closely, it becomes obvious this is no meager
