  (187, 3, $d$This large, carved marble statue dominates the center of this courtyard.
There is a small statue of a knight in the middle, with the water of the
fountain gushing out from beneath the hooves of the great knight's steed.  The
knight has his head fixed, looking forwards into the future, his gaze following
his extended blade pointing fourth.  Just under where the water spills from the
darkened marble there is a small insignia written on a plaque.$d$, $d$This large, carved marble statue dominates the center of this courtyard.
