  (188, 0, $d$   This deed entitles the clan known as the Clandestine Degree to the
following items as paid for in their initial construction costs so long as
they continue to pay maintainance costs of 10% of the total construction
costs by the 5th of each month. At the time dues are collected the seal on
this lease shall be updated to reflect the date the next collection shall
take place.

Note- Lease agreements may be inspected at any time to verify that all dues
      are up-to-date.

