  (237, 61, $d$A large sign is here, outlined in glowing blue flames!
Reading it, it says in common:

WARNING
Beyond this point is a very DANGEROUS place, full of wicked drow!
More importantly, the tiny mist beasts which have made these caverns
their home have taken their toll on many a young adventurer.
Please, to be safe, be sure that you can defeat a mezzoloth before
venturing any further east.  Thank you.

-The Ranger Guild of Mielikki$d$, $d$A large sign is here, outlined in glowing blue flames!
