which is overlaid with an incredibly realistic display of silver leaves.  Each
leaf is different, representing oack, ash, birch, yew, and other trees sacred
to those who hold Nature dear to their hearts.  Intertwining around the leaves
is a delicate vine, representing the unity of those bound by the rings.
Heartbreaking in its purity, it is nevertheless very sturdy and could probably
withstand the harshest of conditions.$d$, $d$Beautiful and delicate, this priceless ring has a base of some soft green metal
