  (238, 0, $d$This ring is very beautiful.  The diamond is a rare blue color, accented by the
platinum it is set in.  Faint outlines of a swirling cloud motif add texture to
the ring, though barely enough to notice.  It looks like it was made for a
lady's hand...  A very wealthy lady's hand.$d$, $d$This ring is very beautiful.  The diamond is a rare blue color, accented by the
