  (238, 4, $d$When placed over the eyes, this extra set of eyes seems to focus one's vision
more, lending detail to even the most plain-seeming objects.  They float in
place magically, synchronizing perfectly with the eyes they are worn over.
Seems a little odd, but they do help.$d$, $d$When placed over the eyes, this extra set of eyes seems to focus one's vision
more, lending detail to even the most plain-seeming objects.  They float in
place magically, synchronizing perfectly with the eyes they are worn over.
