  (238, 6, $d$A sharp icicle seems to be magically preserved, for it does not melt even when
taken to warm climates.  Thin string wrapped around the thick base acts as a
grip, indicating that it could be used as a weapon.  Whether or not it would be
a very effective weapon, however, is yet to be seen.$d$, $d$A sharp icicle seems to be magically preserved, for it does not melt even when
