barbs at the head to cause ripping damage along with the usual bludgeon.  Its
handle is silver with a worn, white leather grip and the head of the goremaul
is inlaid with orichalcum, a rare alloy of gold that is said to be especially
effective against evil creatures.  The weapon hums slightly with a not
unpleasant buzz, constantly reminding someone that it is there.  At the base of
the grip is a holy symbol.$d$, $d$An ancient form of weapon similar to a maul, the goremaul is set with tiny
