entirely too small for a dragon to open or close, so what use could he possibly
have for it?$d$, $d$Almost hidden under a pile of shed scales, this silver strongbox is studded
with brilliant sapphires cut in many shapes and set into intriguing patterns.
It is a rather large chest and appears to have no lock.  Still, it looks
entirely too small for a dragon to open or close, so what use could he possibly
have for it?$d$),
  (238, 87, $d$About the size of your palm, a soft, freshly baked cookie with tiny melting
