  (238, 88, $d$A shimmering, ethereal mask, or perhaps just a trick of the light, it obscures
living features and replaces them with a ghostly skull.  A pallid green glow
emanates from the mask, making delicate stomachs queasy and striking terror
into the hearts of the weak.  Looking at it from the back side, you can barely
make out the word "Dakhod" in translucent letters.$d$, $d$A shimmering, ethereal mask, or perhaps just a trick of the light, it obscures
