flintlock itself is clean and looks like it would fire quickly.  The long steel
barrel is slightly stained black from the powder used to fire it.  Such a
weapon would be extremely dangerous if used improperly.  Engraved on one end of
the barrel is the name "Dakhod".$d$, $d$This pistol is rougly the size of a child's arm, with a solid silver handle to
