  (238, 94, $d$A thin golden hoop, this earring would look perfect on a pirate.  Slender and
yet strong, masculine and yet flamboyant, the earring would look simply dashing
on the right person.  It shines even in dim light as though it was polished
recently.  In script so small it can hardly be seen, the name "Dakhod" is
