  (238, 95, $d$A well-worn and tattered pirate hat, this nifty three-cornered hat sweeps up at
the front and has a faintly embroidered skull and crossbones on it.  Made of a
soft brown felt, this hat would be protective in both sun and rain, not to
mention in salty sea spray.  It has a fringe of brown feathers that are mostly
worn away, and inside the front brim is the faded name "Dakhod" written in
black ink.$d$, $d$A well-worn and tattered pirate hat, this nifty three-cornered hat sweeps up at
