none of those traditional trappings.  A blade made of blackened steel, sharp
yet unrefined, produced for one purpose only: to shed blood in the name of
Demon Lords.  On it is a single eye, the symbol of Yeenoghu, the Beast of
Butchery, so he may watch every kill up close.$d$, $d$Where many tools dedicated to demonic forces are heavily detailed with runes
