  (462, 7, $d$This large suit of armor is made from several large sections of tanned hide,
stitched together in layers with sinews and cord.  The hides clearly come from
several different creatures, lacking uniformity of texture or color.  A full
broad collar and shoulder pads have been collaged together, and the panels hang
long, covering some of the hips and waist for full coverage of the torso.
Some of the sections have fur pressed between them, and other parts are
embellished with fox tails and other large fur pads.  The overall effect is a
patchy, mangy look.$d$, $d$This large suit of armor is made from several large sections of tanned hide,
