  (464, 6, $d$     About as big around as your fist, the smooth off-white surface of this egg
is speckled with tiny flecks of blue and yellow, giving it an almost marbled
appearance.  The egg is warm in your hand, and you can almost feel the beating
of a tiny heart inside it.  Perhaps if kept properly warm and cared for, in a
few days the most wonderful of treasures might be discovered inside.$d$, $d$     About as big around as your fist, the smooth off-white surface of this egg
