  (464, 9, $d$These fine pants are made of a light fabric to which are sewn hundreds of soft
feathers.  The plumage looks to have come from all sorts of birds, with long
blue and green feathers likely from parrots lined up beside the smaller browns,
whites, and greys of birds like finches and budgerigars.  Though their value as
armor might be questionable, the breeches do look to be rather warm and even
comfortable - and a must-have for every dandy's wardrobe!$d$, $d$These fine pants are made of a light fabric to which are sewn hundreds of soft
feathers.  The plumage looks to have come from all sorts of birds, with long
