  (484, 20, $d$This beautifully worked horn is made of shiny gold.  It's pointed at one end,
with a mouthpiece there of polished bone, and opens up like a cone.  It's
suspended from a red cord that attaches to the horn in two places.  The horn is
curved a little in the middle, the better to wrap around your waist a little as
you wear the cord.  You feel a sense of power flow into your body as you
consider the horn.  Perhaps this beautifully crafted horn, created and blessed
by the Goddess of the Hunt, Azkrael, herself, will be just the thing you need
to complete your quest to destroy Lokari.$d$, $d$This beautifully worked horn is made of shiny gold.  It's pointed at one end,
