head, as well.$d$, $d$You see a bouncy red rubber ball! It's so big you can barely hold it in
one hand. You think it'd be a lot of fun to try balancing it on your
head, as well.$d$),
  (488, 3, $d$This is the primary flight feather of the giant cavern hawks near the
