should be.$d$),
  (488, 23, $d$These jesses are made of thick dark-brown leather thongs wrapped around what
seems to be leather gloves.  The thongs dangle a bit, but just looking at the
jesses make you aware of how fast and agile a true falconer must be.  Perhaps
wearing these will make you feel like that as well.$d$, $d$These jesses are made of thick dark-brown leather thongs wrapped around what
