  (489, 3, $d$You see a cuff made of large, rectangular-cut rubies pieced side by side to
form the cuff itself.  A strong-looking clasp holds the cuff together.  The
gemstones are of the highest quality-- pigeon's-blood-red, clear as crystal,
with not a flaw present to the eye.  As you look closer, you can see that each
gem is housed in a copper-colored setting.$d$, $d$You see a cuff made of large, rectangular-cut rubies pieced side by side to
form the cuff itself.  A strong-looking clasp holds the cuff together.  The
gemstones are of the highest quality-- pigeon's-blood-red, clear as crystal,
with not a flaw present to the eye.  As you look closer, you can see that each
gem is housed in a copper-colored setting.$d$),
  (489, 4, $d$You see a braided suede leather belt here. It's twice the length of your
entire body. You've seen this type of belt before-- you're supposed to
take it and wind it around your body twice, loop it in a specific way,
and let the ends fall to your calves. It seems like it'd hamper your
movement, if you did that, but perhaps it will benefit you to the point
that you don't mind it doing that.$d$, $d$You see a braided suede leather belt here. It's twice the length of your
entire body. You've seen this type of belt before-- you're supposed to
take it and wind it around your body twice, loop it in a specific way,
and let the ends fall to your calves. It seems like it'd hamper your
movement, if you did that, but perhaps it will benefit you to the point
that you don't mind it doing that.$d$),
  (489, 5, $d$Just looking at these gloves makes your hands itch with excitement.  They're
made of a leather even thinner than kid leather in a dashing red colour.  They
flare almost to the elbow.  You can tell that even wearing these exquisite
gloves, you would still retain your ability to feel whatever you touch.$d$, $d$Just looking at these gloves makes your hands itch with excitement.  They're
made of a leather even thinner than kid leather in a dashing red colour.  They
flare almost to the elbow.  You can tell that even wearing these exquisite
gloves, you would still retain your ability to feel whatever you touch.$d$),
  (489, 6, $d$You behold a cloak made of some kind of thin, blood-red damasked silk
embroidered over with dark blue silk thread in cunning designs.  The collar is
lined in thick, deep brown fur.  You get the uncanny feeling that this flowing
cloak isn't quite what it seems.  It seems to have a sense of power to it.
Some sense of intuition you didn't even know you had tells you to handle this
cloak carefully.$d$, $d$You behold a cloak made of some kind of thin, blood-red damasked silk
embroidered over with dark blue silk thread in cunning designs.  The collar is
