silvery metal, with claw quillions. A brilliant green emerald forms its
pommel. You sense that only someone truly Good, and truly strong, could
wield this weapon.$d$),
  (489, 10, $d$Shadows coalesce into a tiny sliver roughly the shape and size of a small viper
fang.  Wisps of darkness tumble off the ethereal shape like smoke before
evaporating.$d$, $d$Shadows coalesce into a tiny sliver roughly the shape and size of a small viper
fang.  Wisps of darkness tumble off the ethereal shape like smoke before
