  (489, 12, $d$This is a very sharp, very shiny, and very long needle! As you examine
it, you accidentally poke yourself. A crimson drop of blood wells out of
your fingertip. As you suck your finger, you do notice that its eye doesn't
look very large, for its size.$d$, $d$This is a very sharp, very shiny, and very long needle! As you examine
