why. It's pretty old. Perhaps it's just stuck closed. Whatever the
reason, you take an instant dislike to the locket. You're quite sure it's
going to be nothing but bad news.$d$),
  (489, 14, $d$You behold a beautiful glass shard, about the length of your forearm. It
resembles a stalactite in that it is pyramidal in shape, with a nearly
flat base, narrowing to a wickedly pointed tip.$d$, $d$You behold a beautiful glass shard, about the length of your forearm. It
