  (489, 15, $d$The chest is made of what seems to be dozens of large shards of crystal
or glass. You can't tell how the shards fit together, but the effect
makes the chest seem like it's made of melting ice. The golden hinges,
and a golden clasp, hold a lid made of more shards tightly closed. You
think you can see something through the shards, though you can't tell
what it is because of the distortion of the shards. There doesn't seem to
be any way to get into the chest. The clasp is not locked, but it's held
closed by a glass shard that's gotten loose somehow.$d$, $d$The chest is made of what seems to be dozens of large shards of crystal
