access the Altar of Sending -- somehow. The Rod itself is rather plain,
being ancient yarrow wood stained auburn, and subtly carved with flowing
ivy vine shapes. The head of the staff is slightly bulbous and rounded
gently. The entire staff is just about as tall as you are. It's completely
smooth. It feels completely natural to hold it in your hand.$d$, $d$The Jann have no need of this rod. They can go between Planes with a
mere thought, with a mere wish. But they know that sometimes they require
others to be able to as well. And this Rod gives non-Jann the ability to
