  (533, 21, $d$This sign is jammed into the hard ground and looks to be frozen.
It reads:

   Lowly traveler, many a strong man and woman have taken to
   exploring these tunnels, and few have returned as they entered.
   The tunnel to the south leads to the ruthless horde known as the
   Dragon Cult.  The tunnels west lead to a large section of land known
   local people as Frost Valley.

   From those who have lost loved ones, we wish you a safe journey,
   and hope that you are able to avenge the deaths of those who have
   traveled before you.$d$, $d$This sign is jammed into the hard ground and looks to be frozen.
It reads:

   Lowly traveler, many a strong man and woman have taken to
   exploring these tunnels, and few have returned as they entered.
   The tunnel to the south leads to the ruthless horde known as the
   Dragon Cult.  The tunnels west lead to a large section of land known
   local people as Frost Valley.

   From those who have lost loved ones, we wish you a safe journey,
   and hope that you are able to avenge the deaths of those who have
   traveled before you.$d$),
