  (557, 82, $d$These simple cloth sleeves are dyed in brilliant hues and embroidered with
eye-catching motifs.  They stand out strongly in a crowd, no doubt making their
wearer the center of attention.$d$, $d$These simple cloth sleeves are dyed in brilliant hues and embroidered with
eye-catching motifs.  They stand out strongly in a crowd, no doubt making their
wearer the center of attention.$d$),
  (557, 83, $d$This tunic is made of fine linen backed by simple cotton.  It is dyed sumptuous
colors and embroidered with intricate patterns.  The shoulders are secured with
small gold clasps and the waist is gathered with a fine sash.  The tunic moves
and flows perfectly, accentuating every movement of the body.$d$, $d$This tunic is made of fine linen backed by simple cotton.  It is dyed sumptuous
colors and embroidered with intricate patterns.  The shoulders are secured with
small gold clasps and the waist is gathered with a fine sash.  The tunic moves
and flows perfectly, accentuating every movement of the body.$d$),
  (557, 84, $d$Bright color catches the eye while a harlequin pattern fascinates it.  These
leggings are snug-fitting, ideal for movement by allowing a full range of
motion.  They provide coverage of the whole lower body, wrapping at the waist
and stretching down to the ankle, tucking into a boot or shoe.$d$, $d$Bright color catches the eye while a harlequin pattern fascinates it.  These
leggings are snug-fitting, ideal for movement by allowing a full range of
motion.  They provide coverage of the whole lower body, wrapping at the waist
and stretching down to the ankle, tucking into a boot or shoe.$d$),
  (557, 85, $d$These boots are fashioned from high quality leather, sturdy enough to provide
protection but soft enough to be comfortable to wear for long periods of time.
The soles are the thick soles of traveling shoes, the kind befitting a
wandering troubadour.  Making use of vibrant dyes however, the craftsman has
created a piece of gear that wonderfully combines function with aesthetic for
some flare on the go.$d$, $d$These boots are fashioned from high quality leather, sturdy enough to provide
protection but soft enough to be comfortable to wear for long periods of time.
The soles are the thick soles of traveling shoes, the kind befitting a
wandering troubadour.  Making use of vibrant dyes however, the craftsman has
created a piece of gear that wonderfully combines function with aesthetic for
some flare on the go.$d$),
  (557, 86, $d$Semi-precious stone beads of many types strung along multiple parallel strings
make for a beautiful, if not terribly fancy, bracelet.  With the large variety
of colors, one might call this a "statement piece" rather than a simple
accessory.$d$, $d$Semi-precious stone beads of many types strung along multiple parallel strings
make for a beautiful, if not terribly fancy, bracelet.  With the large variety
of colors, one might call this a "statement piece" rather than a simple
accessory.$d$),
  (557, 87, $d$These are quite fancy for traveling gloves!  They're made of cotton twill so
they hold the vivid colors easily, but they don't keep out the cold very well
They do provide a modicum of protection, but mostly they just look nice.$d$, $d$These are quite fancy for traveling gloves!  They're made of cotton twill so
they hold the vivid colors easily, but they don't keep out the cold very well
They do provide a modicum of protection, but mostly they just look nice.$d$),
  (557, 89, $d$Hanging long and billowing, these masterfully woven sleeves ride on the breeze
like clouds on the waves.  A loose pattern of roses typical of Soltan design is
woven into the richly colored fabric.  Gold embroidered trim makes the perfect
final touch to this rich garment.$d$, $d$Hanging long and billowing, these masterfully woven sleeves ride on the breeze
like clouds on the waves.  A loose pattern of roses typical of Soltan design is
woven into the richly colored fabric.  Gold embroidered trim makes the perfect
final touch to this rich garment.$d$),
  (557, 90, $d$This vest-like garment is something between a typical doublet and a corset,
ideal as the bodice for a formal gown or the vest of a fancy suit.  The heavy
brocade fabric provides a stiffness and stability a more traditional doublet
lacks without the boning of a full corset.  A loose rose motif typical of
Soltan work is woven in with lustrous threads.  It is trimmed with small pearl
bangles around the bottom and top edges, accentuated with golden fasteners.
Truly a masterwork garment!$d$, $d$This vest-like garment is something between a typical doublet and a corset,
ideal as the bodice for a formal gown or the vest of a fancy suit.  The heavy
brocade fabric provides a stiffness and stability a more traditional doublet
lacks without the boning of a full corset.  A loose rose motif typical of
Soltan work is woven in with lustrous threads.  It is trimmed with small pearl
bangles around the bottom and top edges, accentuated with golden fasteners.
Truly a masterwork garment!$d$),
  (557, 91, $d$These leggings are sublime and flowing, graceful and delicate.  Every sweep of
the leg, every turn of the foot perfectly accentuated, they're ideal for
someone living in the limelight.  A flare at the bottom heightens the movement
and the elegance even more.  They are woven with a prime symbol of high society
and class - a loose representation of the Golden Rose of Solta.$d$, $d$These leggings are sublime and flowing, graceful and delicate.  Every sweep of
the leg, every turn of the foot perfectly accentuated, they're ideal for
someone living in the limelight.  A flare at the bottom heightens the movement
and the elegance even more.  They are woven with a prime symbol of high society
and class - a loose representation of the Golden Rose of Solta.$d$),
  (557, 92, $d$Brocade is a very uncommon material for shoes because of how dirty they can
get.  That makes shoes like these extraordinarily rare.  This pair of slippers
is fine brocade stitched over leather for both comfort and support.  The loose
woven pattern of a Soltan rose is accentuated with golden embroidery and
gemstone beads.  A lavish buckle decorates the face of the shoe.  A small
sensible heel adds just that extra touch of height and composure while still
being possible to walk and dance in.$d$, $d$Brocade is a very uncommon material for shoes because of how dirty they can
get.  That makes shoes like these extraordinarily rare.  This pair of slippers
is fine brocade stitched over leather for both comfort and support.  The loose
woven pattern of a Soltan rose is accentuated with golden embroidery and
gemstone beads.  A lavish buckle decorates the face of the shoe.  A small
sensible heel adds just that extra touch of height and composure while still
being possible to walk and dance in.$d$),
  (557, 93, $d$This bracelet is actually several very thin golden rings bound together with
gold wire.  It is decorated with fine rose motifs etched into the bands then
embellished with fine yellow citrines and carnelians native to the region
around Solta.  Reflected light glimmers in all directions like a star twinkling
in the night sky.$d$, $d$This bracelet is actually several very thin golden rings bound together with
gold wire.  It is decorated with fine rose motifs etched into the bands then
embellished with fine yellow citrines and carnelians native to the region
around Solta.  Reflected light glimmers in all directions like a star twinkling
in the night sky.$d$),
  (557, 94, $d$These fine elbow-length velvet brocade gloves are woven with golden thread in
the loose rose pattern, iconic of finery from Solta.  Small beryl gems and
pearls are sewn on with small gold settings, adding both weight and beauty.
They're soft and supple, and lustrous in every way.  They are the perfect gift
for a star of the stage.$d$, $d$These fine elbow-length velvet brocade gloves are woven with golden thread in
the loose rose pattern, iconic of finery from Solta.  Small beryl gems and
pearls are sewn on with small gold settings, adding both weight and beauty.
They're soft and supple, and lustrous in every way.  They are the perfect gift
for a star of the stage.$d$),
