know exactly what magicks are required to become immortal.
Of course, if you could read it, you'd also already be
immortal.$d$, $d$A pity you can't read anything on this paper. It's written
in the language of the gods. If you could read it, you'd
know exactly what magicks are required to become immortal.
Of course, if you could read it, you'd also already be
immortal.$d$),
  (584, 23, $d$It's a thin, light piece of oblong iron with a tiny hook at one end.
