along with chopped-up vegetables.$d$),
  (584, 29, $d$This pendant is made of the very tip of a spiral horn.  It's been drilled so a
primitive chain can support it.  The horn glows with power.$d$, $d$This pendant is made of the very tip of a spiral horn.  It's been drilled so a
