  (586, 2, $d$This formidable wooden object consists of a weathered wooden shaft that ends in
a flipper-like wide wooden paddle.  It's quite heavy.$d$, $d$This formidable wooden object consists of a weathered wooden shaft that ends in
a flipper-like wide wooden paddle.  It's quite heavy.$d$),
  (586, 3, $d$A green sailcloth bag that closes at the top with a drawstring,
this satchel seems like it'd hold a lot of stuff! Straps allow
it to be worn as well as merely held.$d$, $d$A green sailcloth bag that closes at the top with a drawstring,
this satchel seems like it'd hold a lot of stuff! Straps allow
it to be worn as well as merely held.$d$),
  (586, 4, $d$Fine purple cloth, unwrinkled linen, forms what is clearly a robe of high
value.  Golden embroidery lines the hems, cuffs, and shawl collar.  Though
light, the robes seem magical in nature.$d$, $d$Fine purple cloth, unwrinkled linen, forms what is clearly a robe of high
value.  Golden embroidery lines the hems, cuffs, and shawl collar.  Though
light, the robes seem magical in nature.$d$),
  (586, 5, $d$It's just a plain green glass bottle. It doesn't seem
to be ornamented at all, or marked in any way, which is
odd, since most bottle manufacturers mark their wares.$d$, $d$It's just a plain green glass bottle. It doesn't seem
to be ornamented at all, or marked in any way, which is
odd, since most bottle manufacturers mark their wares.$d$),
  (586, 6, $d$They're made of shiny, polished steel that straps on to their wearer's upper
arms.  They're jointed a bit near the elbow to allow freedom of movement; you
watch the joints click into and out of place with fascination.$d$, $d$They're made of shiny, polished steel that straps on to their wearer's upper
arms.  They're jointed a bit near the elbow to allow freedom of movement; you
watch the joints click into and out of place with fascination.$d$),
  (586, 7, $d$You observe well-tanned brown leather cunningly worked into a pair of shoes
that lace with a thong across the arch of the foot.  They're quite new-looking,
even smelling of leather still.  You can tell the material is soft and supple.$d$, $d$You observe well-tanned brown leather cunningly worked into a pair of shoes
that lace with a thong across the arch of the foot.  They're quite new-looking,
even smelling of leather still.  You can tell the material is soft and supple.$d$),
  (586, 8, $d$The scroll appears to be the surveyor's notes of the lay of the land.
There is a PICTURE and a LEGEND here for your perusal.$d$, $d$The scroll appears to be the surveyor's notes of the lay of the land.
There is a PICTURE and a LEGEND here for your perusal.$d$),
  (586, 9, $d$Varying shades of green, this poultice is crushed from freshly-picked
marigolds.  It has a sickly scent, smelling strongly of herbs and medicine.$d$, $d$Varying shades of green, this poultice is crushed from freshly-picked
marigolds.  It has a sickly scent, smelling strongly of herbs and medicine.$d$),
  (586, 10, $d$Nearly three feet tall, the egg is comfortably nestled in the warm sands.
Sunlight highlights the metallic bronze sheen of the egg's speckled shell.
Warmth from the sand and sun make the perfect environment for the growing
creature inside it.$d$, $d$Nearly three feet tall, the egg is comfortably nestled in the warm sands.
Sunlight highlights the metallic bronze sheen of the egg's speckled shell.
Warmth from the sand and sun make the perfect environment for the growing
