allows you to reach down and access the water inside.  As you look in you can
see that the water is very shallow and a small carved passage in written in the
wood on the cover.  It reads: Take only what you need.$d$, $d$   The small well is built from the same faded, grey stone that encompasses the
surrounding wall.  A small wooden roof covers the top of the well, but still
