  (15, 5, ARRAY['engraving', 'priestess', 'stern']::text[], $d$The image of Cerworn is one of a compassionate but serious woman, her eyes
fixed steadily on an image you cannot see.  Her face is fixed in a gentle but
firm motherly expression, a reflection of her beliefs in loving control.  The
priestess is shown to be wearing a simple white dress, her hands folded in
prayer.$d$),
  (15, 5, ARRAY['figure', 'charismatic', 'druidess']::text[], $d$   Tall, but slim, Janara is a beautiful half-elf with long flowing auburn hair
that reaches down to her waist.  Green foliage is wrapped around her exposing
bits of tanned flesh, but covering up the essentials.  A large anaconda is
wrapped around her body, with its head held by her hand, mouth wide open.$d$),
  (15, 5, ARRAY['image', 'terrifying', 'warrior']::text[], $d$A creature of pure and unadulterated evil, Nuggz stands in an intimidating
stance, ready to bash anything that comes his way.  He wears a permanent scowl
on his face, the product of years of living a corrupted life style.$d$),
  (15, 5, ARRAY['visage', 'cunning', 'ranger']::text[], $d$Wehr is leaning on a longbow, his hair long and wild looking.  A gentle
expression on his face makes you relax, and feel all warm inside.  His eyes
seem to be fixed directly upon you, and you feel as if your soul is being
looked at.  A small wolf is standing next to him, looking up into his face as
if asking for direction.$d$),
  (15, 5, ARRAY['carving', 'twisted', 'sorceress']::text[], $d$Glimmering silver hair falls down to the shoulders of this otherwise beautiful
sorceress.  Cold piercing blue eyes indicate that Krytonius is not as nice as
she looks.$d$),
