Only real warriors drink beer and fight!$d$),
  (30, 3, ARRAY['warning', 'label']::text[], $d$The label reads:
    This drink is only for the brave and strong stomached!$d$),
  (30, 31, ARRAY['words', 'bottom']::text[], $d$The words read:
      Type "light lantern" to activate.$d$),
