  (30, 303, ARRAY['closing']::text[], $d$First off we'd like to thank you for taking the time and reading this
pamphlet. If you have any questions, my advice to you would be:

First ->  check to see if there is a HELP file available, by typing
          help <keyword>
Second -> type WHO and look for a higher level player, and politely
          ask them if they'd answer your question using the TELL command.
Third ->  Ask your question politely over the GOSSIP channel, but please
          don't spam GOSSIP with your question over and over if you do not
          receive an answer.

By the way, the ECHOBACK command will enable you to see what you're
saying. Everything else you would want to know can be found in the HELP
files - or ask your fellow players, if you're really stuck.

Now, we wish you good luck!
Get on the road to Immortality...
Good hunting!
                                                Written by: Nocturno
                                           Last updated by: ObiWan (7/96)$d$),
