  (188, 78, ARRAY['runes']::text[], $d$The writing on the wand is in an ancient elvish script and difficult to read,
but seems to describe the wand's contract and usage.  Tapping the wand's power
requires a binding and sacrifice as part of the contract with an unidentified
being of darkness.$d$),
  (237, 1, ARRAY['rune', 'runes']::text[], $d$The runes are carved in a spidery script, reading:
if you are near to the dark
I will tell you 'bout the sun
you are here, no escape
from my visions of the world
you will cry all alone
but it does not mean a thing to me
knowing the song I will sing
till the darkness comes to sleep
come to me, I will tell
'bout the secret of the sun
it's in you, not in me
but it does not mean a thing to you
the sun is in your eyes
the sun is in your ears
I hope you see the sun
someday in the darkness.
Kourrya 2002$d$),
