  (587, 5, ARRAY['embroidery']::text[], $d$The embroidery is of a strange kind. Usually embroidery is of
pretty things, for some sort of informative or decorative purpose,
but this picture is of a monstrous golden wolf-like beast with
eerily human eyes.$d$),
  (590, 3, ARRAY['inscription']::text[], $d$   Melted together from the swords of three brothers, mixed and forged into
two, for the lost third brother will forever be remembered.$d$),
  (590, 6, ARRAY['page3']::text[], $d$For all that are powerful
Bringing fists down on the weak
Smashing their souls
And breaking the meek

May they soon meet their maker
Brought forth for their misdeed
