Stop our troubled existence
Then let us to ascend$d$),
  (590, 6, ARRAY['page1']::text[], $d$   The quaint sounds of spring fill my ears with a joy not found else where.
The breeze showers my skin with the sensations of the air.  This feeling
empowers me with the creativity that is unrivaled by others.  Like floating on
top of the world without the weight of gravity to pull me down.$d$),
  (590, 6, ARRAY['page2']::text[], $d$............THOUGHTS............
