 The greatest thought of them all$d$),
  (590, 15, ARRAY['inscription', '']::text[], $d$   All who wear this badge have served the Sacred Haven with their utmost
ability and proven themselves a great asset to the ranks of the holy.$d$),
  (625, 52, ARRAY['dark-symbol', 'strange', 'demonic', 'rune', 'center-link']::text[], $d$   Upon closer inspection the central link is sized to fit each of your hands,
gripping on either side of it.  Then length of the central chain places the
ruin comfortably between your two wrists such that this grip is easy and
natural to form while wearing the shackles.  The rune has a vertical
double-line doen the center, with sharp cylindrical knobs jutting outward
toward the holders hands.  The inner edges of these two virticle lines are
spaced by eight tightly packed horizontal spikes, pointing in alternating
dirrections, their wicked points tucked safely into the opposing wall of the
cage they form.  You can see that when gripped, the symbol would easily slide
into what seems like two spiked knuckles, though the backward-facing
cylindrical knobs would make then impractical, even dangerous, to the users
exposed knuckles.  What a strange design.$d$)
) AS v(zone_id, object_id, kw, txt)
WHERE d.object_zone_id = v.zone_id AND d.object_id = v.object_id
  AND d.keywords = v.kw
  AND position(E'\n' in d.description) = 0
  AND btrim(regexp_replace(d.description, '\s+', ' ', 'g')) = btrim(regexp_replace(v.txt, '\s+', ' ', 'g'));

COMMIT;
